  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING FAHP FOR THE COORDINATION AND IMPLEM DCD 36108 SLE.FAHP.2024.01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to deliver FGM/C interventions in a coordinated manner and communities become aware of and take actions to end FGM in Sierra Leone. &#xa0;The project has three objectives: 1. Strengthen FAHP Secretariat capacity to coordinate the implementation of FAHP members FGM interventions in Sierra Leone, influencing Zero tolerance.2. Enhance evidence-based advocacy to influence development of national law to end FGM. 3. Increase community awareness and knowledge on the harmful effects of FGM.</narrative>
  </description>
